<BaseLayout title="10 O-Level Comprehension Techniques to Score A1 | A-Worthy" description="10 comprehension techniques top O-Level English students use to score A1. Strategies for inference, vocabulary-in-context and summary questions. From A-Worthy." ogImage="/images/og-english.png">
